    21	     * insures them for is the {@link PriceList}'s to state, and the cap that
    22	     * insurance sum earns is this policy's own rule. Premium modifiers are no
    23	     * part of it, which is why the policy is written from the covered items and
    24	     * never from the premium quoted for them.
